    "speech": "There are certain terms of endearment between men and women, and this is one of them. This is what I have taken as a gift. Now and then when a man feels in need of this sort of thing he gives it to his woman, but it is not an everyday occurrence. It is a sign of great favor. When I give it to this woman, it is a sign that I have a very high opinion of her."
